        "value": "US National Park (e.g., Yellowstone), high-elevation environment."
      },
      {
        "key": "Timing",
        "value": "Late August 2024, typically warm days (60-80°F / 15-27°C), cool to cold nights (30-50°F / -1-10°C), possibility of afternoon thunderstorms or light rain."
